// THE HANGING GARDENS OF BABYLON, about 570 BC: the garden itself (the hero) and the laws of the place.
// A built hill of five brick terraces, 120 m square and 23 m high, at the river corner of the palace: every north front
// a row of brick piers and round arches with dark vaults behind, a stair on the river side, a shut water house at its
// head, thin channels and drips from level to level, fruit trees and palms below, cypress and cedar on top.
// Axes: +x east, +z south, y up; the river's water is y 0, the east quay's edge x 0, the garden's north-west corner (8, 0).
// NOTHING HAPPENS BECAUSE WE COME: everything here stands, or runs on the world clock (drips, threads, leaves).
// DECLARED PACING: none.
//
// SAID IN THE OPEN (rule text BB, point two): WHAT OF THIS WORLD IS PLACED TO BE SEEN FROM THE VISITOR'S WAY, AND
//   BY WHAT EACH THING GOES: what is typed and the same on every seed, what goes by the world's clock, what the
//   visit's seed draws and why. The laws stand in src/parts/hanging-gardens-of-babylon.js under the names given
//   here. WHAT IS LAID, SIZED OR KEPT CLEAR BY A MEASURE TAKEN FROM THE FLOWN LINE is named thing by thing under
//   WHAT IS HANDED THE FLOWN LINE, OR MEASURED FROM IT; nothing else is, and no thing reads where the visitor is or
//   what the lens is; the two laws of optics that read the eye's place are named at the end. Everything named is
//   INVENTED unless it is said to be the brief's. THE OWNER'S RULINGS OF 14:02, 14:11, 14:34, 15:27 AND 17:40 UTC
//   ON 11 OCT 2026, cited here by their time, CAME THROUGH THE DESIGNER AND STAND IN THE DESIGNER'S WORDS, NOT THE
//   OWNER'S: those of 14:02, 14:11 and 14:34 in round 8a's order
//   (design/sw/orders/hanging-gardens-of-babylon-r8a.md) and in the log (design/sw/RUNS.md), those of 15:27 and
//   17:40 in the log; by the designer's word no file holds the first four word for word, and we know of none that
//   holds the fifth so. (Its words of 05:22 and 05:25 UTC stand word for word in
//   design/sw/notes/hanging-gardens-of-babylon-owner-answer-r8-0522.txt and
//   hanging-gardens-of-babylon-owner-answer-audit-three-0525.txt.)
