//     the eye: 1 - exp(-d / 2200). The reach of 2,200 m is the evening's dusty air over a river plain: a hundredth
//     at 20 m (nothing near is veiled), an eighth at 300 m (the blue gate from the top walk keeps its colour), a
//     third at a kilometre (the far city goes pale into the horizon). The scene's own fog stands over it as it
