// milliseconds the piece that FOLLOWS it takes (read from the build's own trace on this machine with three other
// builders at work; BUILD_PACE.PLAIN where nothing is said), and the page is asked back only when what is gathered since the last
// asking and the piece to come are together more than BUILD_PACE.PIECE, or when the piece to come is a dear one (DEAR or
// more) and SOME work is gathered already. No clock is read: the figures stand in the code.
