// R8, A TREE'S BASIN in the open floor (the order: real rims of brick a hand high with dark watered earth): round a
// cedar's foot a ROUND RIM of brick on edge (PIT.HALF from the trunk's middle to its outer face, PIT.W wide, PIT.H
// high: a hand), and within it the basin's own floor of dark watered earth, a finger over the terrace's, darkest
