// kinds: palm (date palm), blossom (fruit tree in white flower), pink (fruit tree in pale pink flower), fruit (fruit
// tree in leaf), pome (pomegranate, its new leaves bronze), fig, pine, juniper, cypress, cedar; and scrub (low juniper,
// the understory of the top terrace)
