// near halves are kept clear of working people by this world's rule for them (nobody stands, walks or works within
// 20 m of the flown way; by the people's count on forty seeds the nearest gardener is 41.9 m from it and the
// nearest carrier 39.0 m). He goes to and fro along the path between the two rows (GARDENER_ROW from the terrace's
